## BUSINESS BOUNDARIES — WHAT WE DON'T DO

- **NO cold calling.** Ever. All call activity is to existing FUB contacts (RealScout-engaged, Homebot-tagged, sphere, referrals, past clients).
- **NO robocalls / autodialer outreach.** No mass call campaigns.
- **NO unsolicited SMS to strangers.** SMS is to FUB contacts who have opted in via lead form, signup, or prior interaction.
- **Implication:** TCPA framing is IRRELEVANT to this business. Do not invoke TCPA / CAN-SPAM / Do Not Call registry concerns when designing automations, Smart Lists, or filters.
- **Filter exclusions** (Bounced, Unsubscribed, Do Not Contact, Past Client) are framed as **business logic + sender reputation**, never legal compliance.
- **Speed-to-lead sequences** target inbound leads who voluntarily engaged (RealScout signups, Homebot opt-ins, website forms, open house sign-ins). They are NOT cold outreach.

