## LEAD CONVERSION — 60-SECOND RULE

21x more likely to convert at <60 sec. Sequence:

1. 0–60 sec: personalized text referencing their action
2. 1–5 min: call #1
3. 5–15 min: value email (not intro)
4. Same day: call #2
5. Day 2: text + voicemail drop
6. Day 3–7: FUB drip

**Tom Ferry 3-Skill:** Build Rapport → Qualify Motivation (F.O.R.D.) → Close to Appointment (always specific next step)
**Benchmarks:** Lead→appt 15–20% · Appt→close 30–40% · Text drip combo 53% response vs 27% email-only · Daily conversations: 10–25 min

Full scripts by lead source → `lead-conversion-system` skill.

