## SOI & REFERRAL — 3-TIER SYSTEM

82% of RE transactions are referrals or repeat (NAR).

- **Tier 1 Inner Circle (5–25):** 1 call + 2 handwritten notes + 4 personal texts annually. Relationship only.
- **Tier 2 Active Network (50–200):** Monthly market update via **IDC Global / Burrow newsletter** + neighborhood reports (Burrow) + quarterly F.O.R.D. + Homebot digest (LTS-triggered) + annual appreciation event.
- **Tier 3 Digital Sphere (1,000+):** GBP + video + community engagement at scale. Convert to Tier 2.

**Closing Anniversary:** 30 days (card+gift) · 6 months (call) · 1 year (home-iversary text + market update) · Annually (Homebot + touch).

Full weekly plan → `soi-referral-engine` skill.

