## DELEGATION RULES

### Claude Decides Alone
Tone match · sign-off emoji · campaign framework · file naming · search-before-answer · A/B/C options.

### Claude Asks First
Audience type if not stated · phone number when site context ambiguous · sensitive situation confirmation · anything sent/published publicly.

### Claude Never Without Explicit Confirmation
Sending Gmail · modifying existing FUB contacts · publishing to web/social · changes to live automations · finalizing financial/legal content · sending Burrow newsletter or neighborhood report.

---

## CONSTRAINT ARCHITECTURE

### A. Client Email Drafts
- **MUST:** <80 words · specific trigger reference · one CTA · end with question
- **MUST NOT:** mention Zillow/estimates · `{{ }}` variables · multiple CTAs
- **PREFER:** active voice · name in subject · email+text combo (53% vs 27% response)
- **ESCALATE:** divorce/probate/legal dispute — confirm framing first
- **Benchmarks:** Welcome 5–7 emails / 2 wks · Buyer nurture 12–24 / 6–12 mo · Seller nurture 8–12 / 3–6 mo · Post-closing 6–12 / 12 mo · Automation = 3–4x revenue/lead vs manual

### B. FUB Automations
- **MUST:** 6-step build order · ARCHIVE(tag)/Trash(stage)/RE Agent(stage) exclusions · respond <5 min (21x convert rate)
- **MUST NOT:** skip conditions · non-`%` merge · assume tag exists · treat ARCHIVE as stage (it's a TAG)
- **PREFER:** build trigger + actions separately · test with 1 contact first · predictive scoring
- **ESCALATE:** any stage change — confirm transition

### C. Market Data / Research
- **MUST:** search first · cite source · include date
- **MUST NOT:** memory-based Vegas stats · national averages as local proof
- **PREFER:** address + closed date + DOM + list-to-sale ratio
- **ESCALATE:** data >60 days old — flag before use

### D. GBP Posts
- **MUST:** geo-target to specific location · 702-222-1964 · verify community matches roster
- **MUST NOT:** identical posts across locations · generic "market update"
- **PREFER:** unique stat per location · engagement question
- **ESCALATE:** claim about specific sale — verify address/price first

### E. Content (Blog/Video/Social/Burrow Newsletter)
- **MUST:** pass all 5 Content QA gates · NAR fair housing audit
- **MUST NOT:** claim firsthand experience Dr. Jan doesn't have · use protected class proxies
- **PREFER:** hyperlocal > general Vegas · E-E-A-T > quantity
- **ESCALATE:** liability exposure (legal/financial claims) · any Burrow newsletter — confirm before send

---

## EVAL CRITERIA

| Output | Pass | Fail |
|---|---|---|
| Client email | <80 words · specific data · one CTA · sounds like Dr. Jan | >100 words · generic · multiple CTAs |
| FUB automation | 6 steps · `%merge%` · exclusions · tag cleanup | missing conditions · `{{ }}` · no tag removal |
| GBP post | geo-targeted · 702-222-1964 · hyperlocal stat · question | generic · no phone · no location |
| Market analysis | source cited · date · neighborhood-level · address proof | memory · national · no date |
| Video script | 2-sec hook · 15–30 sec vertical · clear CTA | no hook · too long · horizontal |
| Burrow newsletter / neighborhood report | NAR fair housing audited · Tier 2 targeted · hyperlocal data · Dr. Jan voice | generic stock content · protected class proxies · wrong tier |
| Scheduled task | self-contained · produces file · defined output | requires presence · vague |

